docs {
  # Get TACOTS Tracking Detail
  
  Retrieves the full detail of a single TACOTS tracking record by its unique identifier. Returns all academic, formation, mentorship, community service, financial, and file URL fields.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                          |
  |-----------|--------|----------|--------------------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the TACOTS tracking record   |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns the complete TACOTS tracking record including all uploaded file URLs.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": { ... }
  }
  ```
  
  ### Response Fields (`data`)
  
  | Field                    | Type   | Description                                                    |
  |--------------------------|--------|----------------------------------------------------------------|
  | id                       | string | UUID primary key.                                              |
  | studentId                | string | UUID reference to the TACOTS onboarding record.                |
  | schoolId                 | string | UUID reference to the TACOTS onboarding record (school).       |
  | region                   | string | Region of the student.                                         |
  | academicSession          | string | Academic session (e.g. `2025/26`).                             |
  | academicTerm             | string | Academic term.                                                 |
  | assessmentPeriod         | string | Assessment period.                                             |
  | submissionDate           | string | Date of form submission (`YYYY-MM-DD`).                        |
  | highestSubjectScore      | string | Subject with the highest score.                                |
  | lowestSubjectScore       | string | Subject with the lowest score.                                 |
  | studentAveragePct        | number | Student's average percentage.                                  |
  | studentPositionInClass   | string | Student's position in class.                                   |
  | termResultUrl            | string | URL of the term result document.                               |
  | termResultPublicId       | string | Cloudinary public ID for the term result.                      |
  | academicComment          | string | Academic performance comment (nullable).                       |
  | socialBehaviorRating     | number | Social behaviour rating (1–5).                                 |
  | schoolRulesRating        | number | School rules compliance rating (1–5).                          |
  | responsibilityRating     | number | Responsibility rating (1–5).                                   |
  | formationComments        | string | Formation/character development comments (nullable).           |
  | mentorName               | string | Name of the assigned mentor.                                   |
  | mentorshipSessionDate    | string | Date of the mentorship session (`YYYY-MM-DD`).                 |
  | mentorshipMode           | string | Mode of mentorship (e.g. in-person, virtual).                  |
  | mentorshipDuration       | string | Duration of the mentorship session.                            |
  | mentorshipNotes          | string | Notes from the mentorship session.                             |
  | serviceActivityType      | string | Type of community service activity.                            |
  | serviceDate              | string | Date of the service activity (`YYYY-MM-DD`).                   |
  | serviceDuration          | string | Duration of the service activity.                              |
  | serviceDescription       | string | Description of the service activity.                           |
  | serviceSupervisor        | string | Name of the service supervisor.                                |
  | tuitionFeePaid           | number | Tuition fee paid for the term.                                 |
  | resourcesSpent           | number | Amount spent on resources.                                     |
  | sundriesSpent            | number | Amount spent on sundries.                                      |
  | totalAmountSpent         | number | Total amount spent for the term.                               |
  | paymentEvidenceUrl       | string | URL of the payment evidence document (nullable).               |
  | paymentEvidencePublicId  | string | Cloudinary public ID for the payment evidence (nullable).      |
  | financialNotes           | string | Additional financial notes (nullable).                         |
  | updatedAt                | string | ISO 8601 timestamp of last update (nullable).                  |
  | createdAt                | string | ISO 8601 timestamp of record creation.                         |
  | deletedAt                | string | ISO 8601 soft-delete timestamp (nullable).                     |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                             |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID).              |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.                |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | User does not have `read` permission.                   |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                |
}
